{
  "description": "将当前表格转换为可编辑专业图表，保留对象身份、位置、样式和其它对象。用已观察的 target 或 path，to=chart；chartType 可选 bar/line/area/pie/donut。categoryColumn/valueColumns 按列从1计数，默认首列类别、其余列数值。软件读取当前表格及声明表头、产生图表身份并一次提交；不要求复制原表格数据或内部编号。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "anyOf": [
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "categoryColumn": {
            "description": "Category column, counted from 1. Defaults to the first column.",
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "chartType": {
            "enum": [
              "bar",
              "line",
              "area",
              "pie",
              "donut"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target": {
            "maxLength": 100,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "to": {
            "const": "chart",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "valueColumns": {
            "description": "Numeric series columns, counted from 1. Defaults to all columns except the category column.",
            "items": {
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
              "maximum": 9007199254740991,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "to",
          "target"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "categoryColumn": {
            "description": "Category column, counted from 1. Defaults to the first column.",
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "chartType": {
            "enum": [
              "bar",
              "line",
              "area",
              "pie",
              "donut"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "path": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "project": {
            "maxLength": 1000,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "to": {
            "const": "chart",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "valueColumns": {
            "description": "Numeric series columns, counted from 1. Defaults to all columns except the category column.",
            "items": {
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
              "maximum": 9007199254740991,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "to",
          "path"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "转换对象类型",
    "targetKinds": [
      "course-instance"
    ]
  },
  "name": "object.convert",
  "version": 1
}
